  m_Name: Grandma_m3_3End
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: "Alright, I\u2019ll leave you to it then."
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Right? Who could ever forget such an amazing game. I was so proud
        of you in that moment.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I know you\u2019ll make us feel the exact same way tonight. I just
        know it!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Of course! I could never forget that game.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Right? Who could ever forget such an amazing game. I was so proud
        of you in that moment.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I know you\u2019ll make us feel the exact same way tonight. I just
        know it!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yep! How could I? I was incredible in that game.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Me too, even though I\u2019m starting to forget things a bit more
        lately."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I could never forget that for the rest of my life.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I remember it like it was yesterday.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Charming_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: We were completely taken aback.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: To think that my little pumpkin could do something as awesome as
        that!
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I remember I scored the game winning goal. The looks on your
      faces afterwards were just incredible.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Assertive_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I just thought it was really cool, and just know that you will make
        us proud like that again.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: All of us.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I don\u2019t have time to talk about that right now Grandma."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -15
  Sappy_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: We were completely taken aback.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: To think that my little pumpkin could do something as awesome as
        that!
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I still remember the faces you guys made right after I scored
      that game winning goal.
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Looking at you in your uniform all ready to kick some butt at the
        game reminded me of it.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: "I know you\u2019ll make us proud like that again."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: I could never forget it, what makes you bring it up now?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Assertive_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I just thought it was really cool, and just know that you will make
        us proud like that again.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: All of us.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yeah, what about it?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: I do, he and I both were so shocked to see our little pumpkin out
        there running around all of those kids and kicking the ball with such force.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: If only he were here to see you today.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: I know he would be just as shocked.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Yeah, do you still remember the look on Grandpa\u2019s face
      when I sent that final ball into the back of the net?"
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
